    {
      "id": 159030,
      "name": "bobbertoriley",
      "username": "bobbertoriley",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bobbertoriley/{size}/1910_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-05T22:29:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If anyone has an extra set, I'd love to get one for a friend who just recently got into Sentinels.&nbsp;<span>He's good with proxies, but I'd like to get him real copies of the new sets since they (should) still be readily available.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>While we're talking about trades, I've got some extras of older sets that I would be willing to send to good homes for other Sentinels stuffs. (EDIT: Claimed stuff now removed)</p><p>- Cosmic Omnitron</p><p>- Redeemer Fanatic</p><p><span>- Prime Wardens + KNYFE: Rogue Agent</span></p><p>- Super Scientific Tachyon</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PM and we can discuss particulars if you're interested in any of the above :)</p>",
