      "raw": "<p>If anyone has an extra set, I&#39;d love to get one for a friend who just recently got into Sentinels.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">He&#39;s good with proxies, but I&#39;d like to get him real copies of the new sets since they (should) still be readily available.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>While we&#39;re talking about trades, I&#39;ve got some extras of older sets that I would be willing to send to good homes for other Sentinels stuffs. (EDIT: Claimed stuff now removed)</p><p>- Cosmic Omnitron</p><p>- Redeemer Fanatic</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">- Prime Wardens + KNYFE: Rogue Agent</span></p><p>- Super Scientific Tachyon</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PM and we can discuss particulars if you&#39;re interested in any of the above :)</p>",
